[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Alternative approach:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Let’s go back and solve the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \frac{9}{s} - \frac{9}{s + 2} = 96
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \Rightarrow \frac{2}{s(s + 2)} = 96
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \Rightarrow s(s + 2) = \frac{1}{48}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Let’s define $ x = s $, so:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m x(x + 2) = \frac{1}{48}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \Rightarrow x^2 + 2x - \frac{1}{48} = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Solve this quadratic:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m x = \frac{-2 \pm \sqrt{4 + \frac{1}{24}}}{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m = \frac{-2 \pm \sqrt{\frac{96 + 1}{24}}}{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m = \frac{-2 \pm \sqrt{\frac{97}{24}}}{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \sqrt{\frac{97}{24}} \approx \sqrt{4.0417} \approx 2.0104
