[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m x = \frac{-2 + 2.0104}{2} \approx \frac{0.0104}{2} \approx 0.0052
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So $ s \approx 0.0052 $ km/h
