[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m t = 240 - \frac{9}{s} \approx 240 - \frac{9}{0.0052} \approx 240 - 1730.77 \approx -1490.77
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Still negative. So this suggests that our earlier assumption that $ s $ is small is not valid.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Final approach: Use the fact that $ s $ and $ s + 2 $ are speeds, so the time is decreasing.
