[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 3: Find $BD^2$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m We are to find $BD^2$, where:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $B = (c, d)$
