[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 4.3: Set equations (3) and (4) equal
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 240 - \frac{540}{s} = 144 - \frac{540}{s + 2}
