[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Use the quadratic formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m s = \frac{-8 \pm \sqrt{8^2 - 4(4)(-45)}}{2(4)} = \frac{-8 \pm \sqrt{64 + 720}}{8} = \frac{-8 \pm \sqrt{784}}{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m s = \frac{-8 \pm 28}{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $ s = \frac{-8 + 28}{8} = \frac{20}{8} = 2.5 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $ s = \frac{-8 - 28}{8} = \frac{-36}{8} = -4.5 $ (discarded, since speed can't be negative)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So $ s = 2.5 $ km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ---
