[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the Geometry
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m In a **rhombus**, the **diagonals are perpendicular** and bisect each other. Since the diagonals intersect at the origin, the **center of the rhombus is at the origin**.
