[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $AC$ (horizontal)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $BD$ (vertical)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Let the endpoints of the diagonals be:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $A = (a, 0)$, $C = (-a, 0)$ (so $AC = 2a$)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $B = (0, b)$, $D = (0, -b)$ (so $BD = 2b$)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So the **vertices** of the rhombus are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $A = (a, 0)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $B = (0, b)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $C = (-a, 0)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $D = (0, -b)$
