[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 2: Use the first scenario
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m **Scenario 1: Speed = $ s $ km/h, time = 4 hours**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
