[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 5: Solve equations (1) and (2)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m From (1):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \frac{9}{s} + \frac{t}{60} = 4 \tag{1}
