[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \left( \frac{9}{s + 2} - \frac{9}{s} \right) = 2.4 - 4 = -1.6
