[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Compute the left-hand side:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} - \frac{9}{s} = 9 \left( \frac{1}{s + 2} - \frac{1}{s} \right) = 9 \left( \frac{s - (s + 2)}{s(s + 2)} \right) = 9 \left( \frac{-2}{s(s + 2)} \right) = -\frac{18}{s(s + 2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m -\frac{18}{s(s + 2)} = -1.6 \Rightarrow \frac{18}{s(s + 2)} = 1.6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Solve:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m s(s + 2) = \frac{18}{1.6} = 11.25
