[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Use quadratic formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m s = \frac{-2 \pm \sqrt{4 + 4 \cdot 11.25}}{2} = \frac{-2 \pm \sqrt{4 + 45}}{2} = \frac{-2 \pm \sqrt{49}}{2} = \frac{-2 \pm 7}{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m s = \frac{5}{2} = 2.5 \text{ km/h} \quad \text{or} \quad s = \frac{-9}{2} \text{ (discarded)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So $ s = 2.5 $ km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ---
