[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 7: Find the Maximum Value of $BD^2$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m From earlier:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
