[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Dot product:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m (2\sqrt{20} \sec \theta)(2\sqrt{20} \sec \phi) + (-2\sqrt{24} \tan \theta)(-2\sqrt{24} \tan \phi) = 0
