[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \Rightarrow x^2 = \frac{6}{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \Rightarrow x = \sqrt{\frac{6}{5}} \text{ or } -\sqrt{\frac{6}{5}}
