[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So we find the **minimum** value of $BD^2$, and that will be the **greatest real number less than** $BD^2$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So we minimize $BD^2 = 80 \sec^2 \theta - 96$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Since $\sec^2 \theta \geq 1$, the **minimum** value of $BD^2$ is:
