[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Where:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $A$ is the area of the triangle,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $s = \frac{a + b + c}{2}$ is the semi-perimeter.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m We also know that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
