[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 4: Use the formula for $AB \cdot AC$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m In triangle $ABC$, with sides $a = BC$, $b = AC$, $c = AB$, and semiperimeter $s = \frac{a + b + c}{2}$, the area $A$ is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m A = r \cdot s = 6s
