[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m abc = 4R \cdot A = 4 \cdot 13 \cdot 6s = 312s
