[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m bc = \frac{312s}{a}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m But we also know that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m s = \frac{a + b + c}{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
