[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 3: Solve the system of equations
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m We now have two equations:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 1. $ \frac{9}{s} = 4 - \frac{t}{60} $   --- (1)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 2. $ \frac{9}{s + 2} = 2.4 - \frac{t}{60} $   --- (2)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
