[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $ s = \frac{-2 + 7}{2} = \frac{5}{2} = 2.5 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $ s = \frac{-2 - 7}{2} = -4.5 $ (discard negative)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So $ s = 2.5 $ km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
