[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 1: Set up equations
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Let’s denote:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $ t $ is the time (in minutes) spent in the coffee shop.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - The total time for the walk (including the coffee shop) is 4 hours = 240 minutes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - The total time when walking at $ s + 2 $ km/h is 2 hours 24 minutes = 144 minutes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Let’s define the time taken for the walk at speed $ s $ as $ T_1 = 240 - t $ minutes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Similarly, the time taken for the walk at speed $ s + 2 $ is $ T_2 = 144 - t $ minutes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m We can write:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \text{Time} = \frac{\text{Distance}}{\text{Speed}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m T_1 = \frac{9}{s} \times 60 = \frac{540}{s}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m T_2 = \frac{9}{s + 2} \times 60 = \frac{540}{s + 2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m But we also know:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m T_1 = 240 - t \quad \text{(1)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m T_2 = 144 - t \quad \text{(2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \frac{540}{s} = 240 - t \quad \text{(3)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \frac{540}{s + 2} = 144 - t \quad \text{(4)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ---
