[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Simplify:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 240 - 144 = \frac{540}{s} - \frac{540}{s + 2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
