[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m s = \frac{-8 \pm \sqrt{784}}{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m s = \frac{-8 \pm 28}{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m We discard the negative root (speed can't be negative):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m s = \frac{20}{8} = \frac{5}{2} = 2.5 \text{ km/h}
