[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the Geometry
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - A **rhombus** has diagonals that **bisect each other at right angles** (in a square, they are perpendicular and equal), but in a general rhombus, the diagonals are not necessarily equal.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - In this case, the diagonals intersect at the **origin**, so the diagonals are symmetric with respect to the origin.
