[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 2: Use the Hyperbola Equation
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m The hyperbola is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
