[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Let’s assume the vertices of the rhombus are at points $A$, $B$, $C$, $D$ on the hyperbola.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Let’s suppose the diagonals are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
