[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m IA^2 + OI^2 = AO^2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m We know $OI = \sqrt{13}$, so:
