[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m IA^2 + 13 = AO^2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m We also know that $AO$ is the distance from the circumcenter to vertex $A$, which is the circumradius $R = 13$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
