[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m [prompt] user
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Every morning Aya goes for a $9$-kilometer-long walk and stops at a coffee shop afterwards. When she walks at a constant speed of $s$ kilometers per hour, the walk takes her 4 hours, including $t$ minutes spent in the coffee shop. When she walks $s+2$ kilometers per hour, the walk takes her 2 hours and 24 minutes, including $t$ minutes spent in the coffee shop. Suppose Aya walks at $s+\frac{1}{2}$ kilometers per hour. Find the number of minutes the walk takes her, including the $t$ minutes spent in the coffee shop.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Please reason step by step. Write your final answer on the last line in the format "Answer: <integer>", using a plain integer without leading zeros.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m assistant
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m <think>
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m </think>
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m [response] We are given the following information:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - Aya walks **9 kilometers** each morning.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - She walks at a constant speed of **$ s $ km/h**.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - The total time for the walk (including the time spent in the coffee shop) is **4 hours**, and the time spent in the coffee shop is **$ t $ minutes**.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - When she walks at **$ s + 2 $ km/h**, the total time is **2 hours and 24 minutes**, including the same $ t $ minutes in the coffee shop.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - We are asked to find the **time** (in minutes) it takes her to walk at **$ s + \frac{1}{2} $ km/h**, including the $ t $ minutes in the coffee shop.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 1: Set up equations
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Let’s denote:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $ t $ = time in minutes spent in the coffee shop.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $ s $ = speed in km/h.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m #### First scenario:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - Walking speed: $ s $ km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - Distance: 9 km
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - Time taken: 4 hours (including $ t $ minutes)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Convert 4 hours to minutes: $ 4 \times 60 = 240 $ minutes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So, total time = time walking + time in coffee shop = 240 minutes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Let’s denote the time walking as $ t_w $, in minutes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Then:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m t_w + t = 240 \quad \text{(1)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Also, the time walking is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \text{Time walking} = \frac{\text{Distance}}{\text{Speed}} = \frac{9}{s} \text{ hours}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Convert to minutes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \frac{9}{s} \times 60 = \frac{540}{s} \text{ minutes}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \frac{540}{s} + t = 240 \quad \text{(2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m #### Second scenario:
