[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the notation
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m In base $ b $, the number $ 17_b $ means:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
