[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m But we are told that $ 9b + 7 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7} $, so:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
