[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Let’s assume that the rhombus is symmetric with respect to the origin, so that $A = (a, b)$, $B = (c, d)$, and the diagonals are $AC$ and $BD$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
