[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the notation
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m In base $ b $, the number $ 17_b $ is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 17_b = 1 \cdot b + 7 = b + 7
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Similarly, the number $ 97_b $ is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 97_b = 9 \cdot b + 7
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
