[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m But we are told that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
