[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 3: Find all $ b > 9 $ such that $ b + 7 \mid 56 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m We need to find all divisors of 56 that are greater than $ 9 - 7 = 2 $, and then subtract 7 to get $ b $.
