[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Now, we look for divisors $ d $ such that $ d > 2 $, and $ b = d - 7 $, and $ b > 9 $.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So:
