[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 1: Set up equations based on the first scenario
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Let’s denote:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $ s $: speed in km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $ t $: time in minutes spent in the coffee shop
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - Total time for the walk (including coffee shop) = 4 hours = 240 minutes
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Let’s denote the time taken for the walk (excluding the coffee shop) as $ T $, in minutes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m T + t = 240 \quad \text{(1)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m The distance is 9 km, so:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \text{Time} = \frac{\text{Distance}}{\text{Speed}} \Rightarrow T = \frac{9}{s} \text{ hours} = \frac{9}{s} \times 60 \text{ minutes} = \frac{540}{s} \text{ minutes}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Substitute into equation (1):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \frac{540}{s} + t = 240 \quad \text{(2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 2: Set up equations based on the second scenario
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m When she walks at $ s + 2 $ km/h, the total time is 2 hours and 24 minutes = 2.4 hours = 144 minutes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m T' + t = 144 \quad \text{(3)}
