[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m (x - p)(p) + (y - q)(q) = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m xp + yq - p^2 - q^2 = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m xp + yq = p^2 + q^2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Also, we know that $O$ is the circumcenter, so $OA = OB = OC = R = 13$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Let’s assume $A = (x, y)$, and $I = (p, q)$.
