[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m But this is too complex.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Let’s try to use the fact that $IA \perp OI$, and use the formula for the inradius and circumradius.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m We are given:
