[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \sin A = \frac{2A}{bc}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \sin A = \frac{2A}{bc}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Substitute into the expression for $bc$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m bc = \frac{12s}{\frac{2A}{bc}} = \frac{12s \cdot bc}{2A} = \frac{6s \cdot bc}{A}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m bc = \frac{6s \cdot bc}{A} \Rightarrow 1 = \frac{6s}{A} \Rightarrow A = 6s
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Which is consistent with our earlier result.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m So we are back to square one.
