[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \frac{a^2}{20} + \frac{a^2}{24} = \frac{b^2}{24} + \frac{b^2}{20}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m \frac{a^2}{20} + \frac{a^2}{24} = \frac{b^2}{24} + \frac{b^2}{20}
