[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m ### Step 4: Use the formula for $AB \cdot AC$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Let’s use the formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m AB \cdot AC = bc = \frac{abc}{a}
