[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Now, we can use the formula for the semi-perimeter:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m $$
