[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $B = (c, d)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m - $D = (-c, -d)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Then the diagonals are $AC$ and $BD$, and their intersection is the origin.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25208)[0m Now, since $ABCD$ is a rhombus, the vectors $ \vec{AB} $ and $ \vec{AD} $ must be equal in length and perpendicular.
